OL,3,ATrump wants AI to be rebranded as super
OL,4,Aintelligence. Will it work?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile some people close to the
OL,7,Fpresident immediately started to use
OL,8,Fthe term, experts have told the BBC it
OL,9,Fis unlikely to gain widespread traction
OL,10,Fin the industry because it is a name
OL,11,Ftypically used to refer to more
OL,12,Fadvanced systems.
OL,14,FThe announcement is Trump's latest
OL,15,Frebranding move after he had the names
OL,16,Fof Lake Ontario and the Gulf of Mexico
OL,17,Fchanged on US maps and federal
OL,18,Fcommunications.
